99 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 58 0 R
/E (Be honest about how I make things. I use AI tools for efficiency and coding, not to replace the fundamentals of creative work. I want to be upfront about it, not pretend every pixel came from scratch. Disclosure isn't weakness. It's integrity.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [15]
>>
